{
  "app_id": 5133900,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "Oh look, the truck is here. A truck delivers a fresh batch of adorable creatures straight to your factory. Unfortunately for them, they're also your main source of income. First, you need them dead. Grab your weapons and clear out the factory. Now turn them into something useful. Grab the bodies and throw them into the crusher. Get those cans into the tube. Your freshly processed cans still need to be sold. Reinvest in the business. Get stronger weapons. Upgrade your vacuum. Unlock machines. Build conveyors. Increase production. Bring in more creatures. Automate the factory."
  },
